<title>INDONESIA: Bank Mashill says Q3 1996 net up.</title>
<headline>Bank Mashill says Q3 1996 net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>		 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 18.10  vs  12.20</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)  166.36 vs 111.75</p>
<p>    Net interest income	    56.32  vs  39.18</p>
<p>    Other operating income	  1.99  vs   1.25</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 25.94  vs  18.25</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		   25.84  vs  17.36</p>
<p>Note : The results were unaudited. PT Bank Mashill is a privately-owned bank.</p>
<p>--- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
